      "text": "\\(\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}=\\mathrm{E}_{\\text {cell }}^{\\mathrm{o}}-\\frac{\\mathrm{RT}}{2 \\mathrm{~F}} \\ln \\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}\\right]}{\\left[\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}\\right]}\\)",
